==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|scheitele|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|sceitila|lang=goh}}, {{term|skeitila||crest, summit, hill|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*skaidlō}}, {{m|gem-pro|*skaidilō||top, crown, summit}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*skÁit-||to cut, part, separate}}.

===Noun===
'''Scheitel''' ''m'' (''pl'' Scheitel)

# [[parting]] (hair)
# [[maximum]], [[apex]] (mathematics)

